# CANONICAL HOME: invaros-tbom-spec/conformance/qualification/1.0.0/
# These are the criteria for the qualification artifact schemas themselves.
# The architecture requires that the schemas ship with their own conformance
# vectors: a qualification architecture that cannot be qualified has the defect
# it exists to fix.
#
# Covers every *.json file in this directory, on the same terms as the Profile 4
# criteria manifest. A gate fails on a digest mismatch, on a listed file that is
# missing, and on a *.json file present here but absent from this list. There is
# no override flag. Changing a criterion means editing this manifest in the same
# commit, which makes the change visible in review.
#
# Regenerate with:  sha256sum *.json | LC_ALL=C sort -k2
